<title>USA: InterDigital gets $43M Pakistan phone order.</title>
<headline>InterDigital gets $43M Pakistan phone order.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>InterDigital Communications Corp said Wednesday it had received a $43 million order from Pakistan Telecommunication Co Ltd for Ultra Phone digital wireless local loop systems.</p>
<p>IDC spokeswoman Susan Sutton said the Pakistan order and a $600,000 order from Telecom Namibia are the first two to be obtained through IDC's alliance with Siemens AG.</p>
<p>IDC markets its Ultra Phone technology independently and in cooperation with Siemens which offers it to Siemens customers, Sutton said.</p>
</text>
